U01.2|I am tired.|我累了。|I am ready.|我准备好了。|You are busy.|你很忙。|She is a student.|她是一名学生。
U01.4|Is this your bag?|这是你的包吗？|Is this my cup?|这是我的杯子吗？|Is this a school?|这是一所学校吗？|Is this your room?|这是你的房间吗？
U02.1|I drink water at home.|我在家喝水。|You drink water every day.|你每天喝水。|We drink water after work.|我们下班后喝水。|They drink water in the morning.|他们早上喝水。
U02.2|I read books at home.|我在家读书。|You read books every day.|你每天读书。|We read books after work.|我们下班后读书。|They read books in the morning.|他们早上读书。
U02.3|I go home after work.|我下班后回家。|You go home at night.|你晚上回家。|We go home together.|我们一起回家。|They go home every day.|他们每天回家。
U03.1|I have a bag.|我有一个包。|I have a cup.|我有一个杯子。|I have a question.|我有一个问题。|I have a job.|我有一份工作。
U03.2|My book is here.|我的书在这里。|My bag is here.|我的包在这里。|My cup is here.|我的杯子在这里。|My room is small.|我的房间很小。
U04.1|I do not drink tea.|我不喝茶。|I do not read at night.|我晚上不读书。|I do not work here.|我不在这里工作。|I do not need help.|我不需要帮助。
